Subject: [PATCH 47/48] GRPO: checkpointing.save_before_validation saves a step
 before validating it

In async GRPO a step that both saves a checkpoint and validates validated first and saved after. A failure during the validation then lost every step since the previous checkpoint (64K coding run, job 1298910: the Gym servers failed in the validation of step 40 and the run resumed from step 20). With checkpointing.save_before_validation=true such a step saves first and validates after; the checkpoint then carries no validation metric, so it fits checkpoints kept by recency. Steps that save on the time limit and colocated generation keep the old order. Default off.
---
